===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|amino acid|organic compound}} A [[lipotropic]], [[sulphur]]-[[containing]] [[essential amino acid]], C<sub>5</sub>H<sub>11</sub>NO<sub>2</sub>S, found in most [[protein]].
#* {{quote-book|en|year=1999|author=w:Matt Ridley|title=Genome|publisher=Harper Perennial|year_published=2004|page=253
|passage=The purpose was to make soya beans more healthy for those for whom they are a staple food by correcting soya beans' natural deficiency in a chemical called '''methionine'''.}}

